            "[PlantainForage].Root.Removed.Wt",
            "([PlantainForage].Leaf.Senesced.Wt + [PlantainForage].Stem.Senesced.Wt + [PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Senesced.Wt + [PlantainForage].Taproot.Senesced.Wt + [PlantainForage].Root.Senesced.Wt) as PlantainForage.Senesced.Wt",
            "",
            "([PlantainForage].Leaf.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Leaf.Senesced.Wt) as Leaf.NetGrowthRatePerDay",
            "([PlantainForage].Stem.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Stem.Senesced.Wt) as  Stem.NetGrowthRatePerDay ",
            "([PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Senesced.Wt) as Inflorescence.NetGrowthRatePerDay",
            "(([PlantainForage].Leaf.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Leaf.Senesced.Wt)+ ([PlantainForage].Stem.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Stem.Senesced.Wt)+ ([PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Senesced.Wt)) as PlantainForage.NetGrowthRate",
            "",
            "Mean of (([PlantainForage].Leaf.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Leaf.Senesced.Wt)+ ([PlantainForage].Stem.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Stem.Senesced.Wt)+ ([PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Allocated.Wt - [PlantainForage].Inflorescence.Senesced.Wt)) from [Clock].StartOfMonth to [Clock].EndOfMonth as MonthlyMeanNetGrowth",
